class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[L] = K_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，50% 的受体被占据。这是药物剂量设计的重要参数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"受体动力学-内吞-降解与再循环\">受体动力学：内吞、降解与再循环</h3><p>受体激活后通过网格蛋白介导的内吞（CME）进入胞内：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>受体激活</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>磷酸化</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>ubiquitin/arrestin结合</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>内吞</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>早期内体</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{受体激活} \\to \\text{磷酸化} \\to \\text{ubiquitin/arrestin结合} \\to \\text{内吞} \\to \\text{早期内体}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">受体激活</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">磷酸化</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ubiquitin/arrestin</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">结合</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内吞</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">早期内体</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>内体分选决定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>再循环</strong>：受体返回细胞表面（如转铁蛋白受体）</li>\n<li><strong>降解</strong>：ESCRT 途径将受体分选到多囊体（MVB）→ 溶酶体降解</li>\n<li><strong>信号内体</strong>：内吞后继续传信（如 TrkA 的逆向运输）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>受体下调（Downregulation）</strong>：持续刺激 → 受体降解 → 脱敏。这是药物耐受性的机制之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核受体-基因表达的直接调控者\">核受体：基因表达的直接调控者</h3><p>核受体是唯一直接充当转录因子的受体类型。</p>\n<p><strong>结构模块</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>N 端激活功能域（AF-1）</li>\n<li>DNA 结合域（DBD, 锌指结构）</li>\n<li>配体结合域（LBD）</li>\n<li>C 端激活功能域（AF-2）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>作用机制</strong>：疏水性配体（类固醇激素、甲状腺激素、维甲酸）穿过细胞膜 → 结合核受体 → 受体二聚化 → 结合 DNA 上的激素响应元件（HRE）→ 招募共激活子 → 基因转录。</p>\n<p><strong>药物靶标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>他莫昔芬（Tamoxifen）</strong>：雌激素受体的选择性调节剂（SERM），乳腺癌治疗</li>\n<li><strong>地塞米松（Dexamethasone）</strong>：糖皮质激素受体激动剂，抗炎</li>\n<li><strong>贝沙罗汀（Bexarotene）</strong>：视黄酸 X 受体（RXR）激动剂</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"受体靶向治疗策略\">受体靶向治疗策略</h3><p><strong>治疗性抗体</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>曲妥珠单抗（Trastuzumab）</strong>：抗 HER2，乳腺癌</li>\n<li><strong>贝伐珠单抗（Bevacizumab）</strong>：抗 VEGF，多种癌症</li>\n<li><strong>纳武利尤单抗（Nivolumab）</strong>：抗 PD-1，免疫检查点</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>小分子抑制剂</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>伊马替尼（Imatinib）</strong>：BCR-ABL/KIT 激酶抑制剂</li>\n<li><strong>吉非替尼（Gefitinib）</strong>：EGFR 激酶抑制剂</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>双特异性策略</strong>：双特异性抗体同时靶向两个受体或将免疫细胞重定向到肿瘤（如 BiTE 抗体 Blinatumomab）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>解释为什么 EGFR 过表达和 EGFR 激活突变都能导致肿瘤发生，但治疗策略不同。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>计算：某药物的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_d = 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> nM，欲使90%的受体被占据需要多少浓度的药物？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 GPCR 和 RTK 在信号持续时间和空间分布上的差异。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论受体内吞如何在&quot;信号终止&quot;和&quot;信号传播&quot;之间发挥双重作用。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么免疫检查点抑制剂（如抗 PD-1 抗体）能够增强抗肿瘤免疫应答？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Lemmon &amp; Schlessinger (2010) &quot;Cell signaling by receptor tyrosine kinases&quot; 是 RTK 信号的权威综述。</li>\n<li>Sorkin &amp; von Zastrow (2009) &quot;Endocytosis and signalling: intertwining molecular networks&quot; 讨论了内吞与信号的关系。</li>\n<li>Mangelsdorf et al. (1995) &quot;The nuclear receptor superfamily&quot; 是核受体分类学的经典论文。</li>\n<li>PDB（蛋白质数据库）提供了大量受体-配体复合物的三维结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>受体是细胞信号转导的入口，不同类型的受体通过不同的分子机制将胞外信号转化为胞内响应。配体-受体结合的亲和力和动力学参数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>on</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_{\\text{on}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">on</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>off</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_{\\text{off}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">off</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）决定了信号的灵敏度和持续时间。受体内吞和再循环构成了信号调控的重要维度。受体作为药物靶标的重要性无可比拟——从小分子激动剂/拮抗剂到治疗性抗体，受体靶向药物已成为现代药物发现的主流策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 分子生物学 — 受体生物学","id":"研究生-分子生物学-受体生物学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"受体的基本分类","id":"受体的基本分类"},{"level":3,"text":"配体-受体相互作用的定量描述","id":"配体-受体相互作用的定量描述"},{"level":3,"text":"受体动力学：内吞、降解与再循环","id":"受体动力学-内吞-降解与再循环"},{"level":3,"text":"核受体：基因表达的直接调控者","id":"核受体-基因表达的直接调控者"},{"level":3,"text":"受体靶向治疗策略","id":"受体靶向治疗策略"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 信号转导通路","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/cell-signaling/signal-transduction-pathways"},"next":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 系统生物学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/cell-signaling/systems-biology"}}